[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18720.868, "timestamp": "05:12:00", "text": "何らかの理由でそれが欠落している。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18727.27, "timestamp": "05:12:07", "text": "なぜオブジェクト変数が取得されるのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18730.23, "timestamp": "05:12:10", "text": "それは全体として"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18733.83, "timestamp": "05:12:13", "text": "そうなの？それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18735.43, "timestamp": "05:12:15", "text": "のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18737.03, "timestamp": "05:12:17", "text": "ボタン"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18742.788, "timestamp": "05:12:22", "text": "それはボタンのはずじゃないですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18754.788, "timestamp": "05:12:34", "text": "だって、その中には凝縮液が入っているから。しかし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18759.19, "timestamp": "05:12:39", "text": "それとも私の考えが間違っているのでしょうか？何てことだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18761.75, "timestamp": "05:12:41", "text": "ええ、それは引用です。わかった。だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18764.948, "timestamp": "05:12:44", "text": "それは物体です、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18769.43, "timestamp": "05:12:49", "text": "変数ではありません。うん。それで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18775.51, "timestamp": "05:12:55", "text": "エントリ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18778.23, "timestamp": "05:12:58", "text": "行"}]